# meta-research environment
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy to `.env` (which is gitignored) and fill in as needed.
#
# IMPORTANT: meta-research is agent-run. The deterministic CLI commands
# (`meta-research seed | eval | frontier | init`) and the bundled numerical
# evaluator do NOT need any API key -- they are pure, offline, local tools.
#
# An Anthropic credential is only needed for the Claude Code *agent session*
# that runs the research loop in-session. Claude Code can authenticate via your
# Claude subscription (no key needed) OR via an API key. If you use a key:

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional, only for an `api`-mode ApiSolverEvaluator selected in prepare.py
# (a real REST solver endpoint). Leave unset for numerical / surrogate domains.

# META_RESEARCH_SOLVER_URL=https://your-solver.example.com/solve
# META_RESEARCH_SOLVER_TOKEN=
